=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq uagb-faq__outer-wrap uagb-block-291f6fb7 uagb-faq-icon-row uagb-faq-layout-grid uagb-faq-expand-first-true uagb-faq-inactive-other-true uagb-faq__wrap uagb-buttons-layout-wrap uagb-faq-equal-height     \" data-faqtoggle=\"true\" role=\"tablist\"><script type=\"application\/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/cutestoryevents.com\\\/faqs\\\/\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What types of events do you specialize in?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We plan a wide range of events, including:<br><br>\\u25ba Conferences &amp; Expos<br>\\u25ba Festivals<br>\\u25ba Virtual &amp; Hybrid Events<br>\\u25ba Corporate Meetings<br>\\u25ba Holiday Parties<br>\\u25ba Team Building Events<br>\\u25ba Workshops &amp; Summer Camps<br>\\u25ba Company Dinners &amp; Private Parties<br><br>If your event type isn't listed, feel free to reach out\\u2014we love new challenges!\\u00a0<br>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What services do you offer?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Our comprehensive event planning services include:<br><br>\\u25ba Agenda Development<br>\\u25ba Sponsor &amp; Vendor Management<br>\\u25ba Registration Coordination<br>\\u25ba On-site Management<br>\\u25ba Site Selection &amp; Contract Negotiation<br>\\u25ba Timeline Management<br>\\u25ba  Volunteer &amp; Speaker Management<br>\\u25ba Travel Coordination<br><br>We tailor our services to meet your specific event needs.\\u00a0\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How does the planning process work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Our planning process is designed to be straightforward and collaborative:<br><br><em>1. Initial Inquiry: <\\\/em>Fill out our contact form with your event details.<br><em>2. Information Gathering: <\\\/em>You'll receive a Google Form to provide more specifics about your event.<br><em>3. Consultation: <\\\/em>We'll schedule a 45-minute meeting to discuss your vision.<br><em>4. Proposal: <\\\/em>After our meeting, we'll send a detailed proposal outlining services, timelines, and budget.<br><em>5. Agreement:<\\\/em> Upon approval, we'll provide a contract and invoice for the deposit.<br><em>6. Planning: <\\\/em>We'll dive into the details and start bringing your event to life.<br><em>7. Execution: <\\\/em>On the event day, we manage all aspects to ensure everything runs smoothly.<br><em>8. Post-Event:<\\\/em> We'll follow up to gather feedback and discuss future collaborations.<br><br>We tailor our services to meet your specific event needs.\\u00a0\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is your starting price for event planning services?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Our event planning services start at $350+, depending on the size, complexity, and scope of your event. After our initial consultation and review of your event needs, we\\u2019ll provide a custom quote tailored to your goals and budget.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you offer virtual event planning?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Absolutely! We have experience planning virtual and hybrid events for up to 400 attendees, ensuring engaging and seamless experiences for all participants.\\u00a0\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where are you located, and do you travel?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We're based in the Pacific Northwest but offer both remote and in-person event planning services across the United States.\\u00a0\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How can I get started with Cute Story Events?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To begin planning your event with us:<br>\\u25ba  Contact Us: Fill out our contact form or call\\\/text us at 253-389-9528.<br>\\u25ba  Stay Connected: Follow us on\\u00a0<a href=\\\"https:\\\/\\\/www.instagram.com\\\/cutestoryevents\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\">Instagram<\\\/a>\\u00a0and\\u00a0<a href=\\\"https:\\\/\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\/in\\\/ryan-c-048216263\\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\">LinkedIn<\\\/a>\\u00a0for updates and inspiration.\\u200b\"}}]}<\/script><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-26ac622c \" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><h2 class=\"uagb-question\">What types of events do you specialize in?<\/h2><\/div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>We plan a wide range of events, including:<br><br>\u25ba Conferences &amp; Expos<br>\u25ba Festivals<br>\u25ba Virtual &amp; Hybrid Events<br>\u25ba Corporate Meetings<br>\u25ba Holiday Parties<br>\u25ba Team Building Events<br>\u25ba Workshops &amp; Summer Camps<br>\u25ba Company Dinners &amp; Private Parties<br><br>If your event type isn&#8217;t listed, feel free to reach out\u2014we love new challenges!\u00a0<br><\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-199661fd \" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><h2 class=\"uagb-question\">What services do you offer?<\/h2><\/div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Our comprehensive event planning services include:<br><br>\u25ba Agenda Development<br>\u25ba Sponsor &amp; Vendor Management<br>\u25ba Registration Coordination<br>\u25ba On-site Management<br>\u25ba Site Selection &amp; Contract Negotiation<br>\u25ba Timeline Management<br>\u25ba  Volunteer &amp; Speaker Management<br>\u25ba Travel Coordination<br><br>We tailor our services to meet your specific event needs.\u00a0<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-e01ac13f \" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><h2 class=\"uagb-question\">How does the planning process work?<\/h2><\/div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Our planning process is designed to be straightforward and collaborative:<br><br><em>1. Initial Inquiry: <\/em>Fill out our contact form with your event details.<br><em>2. Information Gathering: <\/em>You&#8217;ll receive a Google Form to provide more specifics about your event.<br><em>3. Consultation: <\/em>We&#8217;ll schedule a 45-minute meeting to discuss your vision.<br><em>4. Proposal: <\/em>After our meeting, we&#8217;ll send a detailed proposal outlining services, timelines, and budget.<br><em>5. Agreement:<\/em> Upon approval, we&#8217;ll provide a contract and invoice for the deposit.<br><em>6. Planning: <\/em>We&#8217;ll dive into the details and start bringing your event to life.<br><em>7. Execution: <\/em>On the event day, we manage all aspects to ensure everything runs smoothly.<br><em>8. Post-Event:<\/em> We&#8217;ll follow up to gather feedback and discuss future collaborations.<br><br>We tailor our services to meet your specific event needs.\u00a0<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-5cbf975f \" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><h2 class=\"uagb-question\">What is your starting price for event planning services?<\/h2><\/div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Our event planning services start at $350+, depending on the size, complexity, and scope of your event. After our initial consultation and review of your event needs, we\u2019ll provide a custom quote tailored to your goals and budget.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-6342ac1b \" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><h2 class=\"uagb-question\">Do you offer virtual event planning?<\/h2><\/div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Absolutely! We have experience planning virtual and hybr